{"meta": {"notice": "No API key, so this request shares one free daily budget ($0.10) with everyone on your network's IP address. Get a free key with its own $1/day at https://openalex.org/settings/api and add api_key=YOUR_KEY to your requests. An AI agent can get one for its user in one call: POST https://api.openalex.org/api-keys with {\"email\": \"<your user's email>\"}; we email them a link, and the key works once they click it. Docs for agents: https://help.openalex.org/llms.txt", "count": 2975, "db_response_time_ms": 245, "page": 1, "per_page": 20, "groups_count": null, "x_query": {"oql": "get works with (合伙人 制度 控制权) in the full text", "x_new_oql": "get works with (合伙人 制度 控制权) in the full text", "oqo": {"get_rows": "works", "filter_rows": [{"column_id": "fulltext.search", "value": "合伙人 制度 控制权", "operator": "has"}]}, "url": "/works?filter=fulltext.search:%E5%90%88%E4%BC%99%E4%BA%BA %E5%88%B6%E5%BA%A6 %E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%9D%83&per_page=20", "order": "best matches first", "order_default": true}, "cost_usd": 0.001}, "results": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/W2464632587", "doi": null, "title": "公司控制权配置创新：基于阿里巴巴“合伙人”制度的案例研究", "publication_date": "2015-07-09", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": null, "display_name": "钟辰", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "钟辰", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": null, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2464632587", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "https://dspace.xmu.edu.cn/handle/2288/95842", "pdf_url": null, "source": null, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": null, "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1521159911", "doi": null, "title": "有限合伙人合伙事务执行权与“控制权规则”研究", "publication_date": "2014-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5013359212", "display_name": "何晓楠", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "何晓楠", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国《合伙企业法》第六十八条第一款原则禁止有限合伙人享有合伙事务执行权即＂禁止执行合伙事务规则＂,与第七十六第一款＂表见合伙规则＂合并适用,构成了＂控制权规则＂。但＂禁止执行合伙事务规则＂系对两权分离与有限责任关系的误识,违背了私法自治之合同自由原则,属不当限制有限合伙人内部经营管理表决权等正当权利,亦难以实现《合伙企业法》鼓励风险投资和债权人保护的立法目的,在实践中极易引发有限合伙人规避法律行为,徒增法律风险和法律成本。参鉴美国合伙企业法律制度的立法和实践,我国有限合伙法律制度应修正＂控制权规则＂：取消＂禁止执行合伙事务规则＂,允许有限合伙人和普通合伙人通过合伙协议对合伙事务内部经营管理的表决权进行分配,并相应修改第七十六条第一款,将第三人信赖理由限定为有限合伙人以普通合伙人身份对外代表合伙企业,形成第三人信赖的普通合伙人的表见外观,以与有限合伙人行使表决权参与内部经营决策即行使合伙事务执行权相区别。同时,法律应通过建构＂刺破有限合伙面纱规则＂,防止有限合伙人滥用合伙事务执行权和有限责任。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1521159911", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/97922B/201401/49294875.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764556762", "display_name": "Journal of Nanjing University of Finance and Economics", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "南京财经大学学报", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2413029519", "doi": null, "title": "阿里巴巴“合伙人”制度评价及启示", "publication_date": "2016-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5001067736", "display_name": "昝新明", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "昝新明", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5087694297", "display_name": "郭秀存", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "郭秀存", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"自2014年9月19日阿里巴巴在纽约证券交易所正式挂牌后，伴随着大规模的融资，公司创始人控制权被稀释的难题横亘在马云及其创业团队面前。为破解该问题带来的困境，马云及其创业团队设置了“合伙人”股权制度。本文正是基于此采探究阿里巴巴“合伙人”制度设立的背景、具体内容，以及该制度存在的利与弊，并从中得到一些促进民营企业股权建设的启示。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2413029519", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/80519X/201602/667915604.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306558544", "display_name": "财会月刊（上）", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "财会月刊（上）", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2302363543", "doi": null, "title": "论我国公司控制权锁定规则的建构——以阿里巴巴“合伙人制”为视角", "publication_date": "2015-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5031842907", "display_name": "郑玉洁", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "郑玉洁", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"备受争议的＂合伙人制＂使得阿里巴巴创始人马云等在公司上市后能继续控制公司,研究表明,合伙人制是一种新型的公司控制权锁定模式。从国内外公司治理经验来看,除了＂合伙人制＂模式以外,还有另外两种控制权锁定模式,即＂多数股份决＂模式和＂超级投票权＂模式,但是,突破传统的＂多数股份决＂模式已经是一种国际趋势。然而,我国公司采取单一的＂股份多数决＂模式,导致问题重重。为顺应国际趋势和吸引更多创新型公司在国内上市,提高我国证券市场的竞争力,需要建构公司控制权锁定规则,弥补制度空白。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2302363543", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81762X/201522/665765021.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306542351", "display_name": "中国集体经济", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "中国集体经济", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1032633258", "doi": null, "title": "股权稀释过程中公司控制权保持：法律途径与边界 以双层股权结构和马云“中国合伙人制”为研究对象", "publication_date": "2015-05-15", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5061635051", "display_name": "马一", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "马一", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"公司在成长、扩张过程中需要不断融资，因而创始人的股权可能被反复稀释，以至于创始人在公司能够上市的时候有可能已经沦为小股东。公司创始人为避免控制权旁落，需要用特殊的制度来安排公司管理权限、公司董事的选举方式。双层股权结构模式是公司控制权保持的利器，在西方被广泛运用。近期马云的“中国合伙人制”显示出东方智慧。面对“融资与股权稀释”困境，我国《公司法》有必要适度矫正“同股同权”原则，引进保持公司控制权的制度，同时厘定其法律边界。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1032633258", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81439X/201403/662209073.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306542435", "display_name": "中外法学", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "中外法学", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2269972426", "doi": null, "title": "论股东本位——阿里巴巴公司“合伙人”制度引发的思考", "publication_date": "2014-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5084014956", "display_name": "周珺", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "周珺", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"阿里巴巴公司以“合伙人”架构在海外上市，这迅速成为业界关注的一个焦点。这种“合伙人”制度其实涉及公司法中一个长久争论的话题，即公司法是否应当奉行股东本位的理念。无论是检视法律逻辑，还是考察实际功效，股东本位均优于其他可选项。我国公司法应坚守股东本位，将股东利益最大化作为公司的目标，将公司的控制权归属于股东。同时，公司法可作类型化处理，对于封闲公司，授权“合伙人”决定公司董事人选，属于股东处分自身权利，不会损害第三人的利益或社会公众利益，法律无禁止必要：对于公众公司，股权会比较分散，为维护投资者合法权益，保障公司稳健运行。应当对此设立禁止性．规范，即使“合伙人”公司制度得到全体股东同意也不得例外。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2269972426", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81084X/201411/662418682.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306549476", "display_name": "政治与法律", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "政治与法律", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1136075845", "doi": null, "title": "论风险投资有限合伙人“执行合伙事务”行为暨权力之边界", "publication_date": "2012-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5009117068", "display_name": "甘培忠", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "甘培忠", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": null, "display_name": "李科珍", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "李科珍", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"美国有限合伙组织法的默认规则是将经营决策权集中赋予普通合伙人，有限合伙人如果“参与合伙事务的控制”，则可能丧失有限责任保护，有限合伙人一向被认为是典型的“被动投资者”。有限合伙组织法规则并非决定投资者管理积极性的唯一因素。投资规模与投资集中度，投资者异质性、投资者自身的代理问题、文化传统等因素共同影响有限合伙人执行合伙事务的积极性与意愿。我国借鉴美国有限合伙法，原则上剥夺了有限合伙入执行合伙事务的权利。然而，考虑到我国风险资本来源、商业信誉环境、投资文化等与美国差别迥异，在我国当前环境下，以不改变有限合伙内部两类合伙人之间的基本权力配置模式为前提，赋予有限合伙人适当的执行合伙事务的权力，是合伙企业法应有的宽容。因此，法律的适度修订具有必要性。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1136075845", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81622X/201202/41043955.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306553700", "display_name": "法学评论", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "法学评论", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1169914013", "doi": null, "title": "我国《合伙企业法》再完善研究——以民族地区发展的视角", "publication_date": "2013-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5003100029", "display_name": "王乐宇", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "王乐宇", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国《合伙企业法》的颁行对民族地区的合伙企业发展具有重要意义.在其积极影响下,我国民族地区的合伙企业在本世纪初期呈现出宏观上的递进发展态势.为更好地发挥法律制度对经济发展的调控作用,现行《合伙企业法》虽已是修订产物,亦应检视自身不足并作出进一步的改进.囿于地方立法在规制合伙企业上成效不够明显,我国民族地区对进一步完善《合伙企业法》有着迫切诉求.我国《合伙企业法》可在当场登记制度、不执行合伙事务合伙人权利制度、合伙人基本义务制度、合伙人变动制度等方面作出进一步完善.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1169914013", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/70277A/201303/47509862.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764509995", "display_name": "Journal of Inner Mongolia University of Finance and Economics", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "内蒙古财经大学学报", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1015213751", "doi": null, "title": "流动人口犯罪：现状、原因与防控对策", "publication_date": "2012-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5026007334", "display_name": "张阳", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "张阳", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5017667058", "display_name": "刘德法", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "刘德法", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"流动人口犯罪是指基于经济目的和动因而离开户籍所在地的自然人所实施的刑事违法行为。现阶段我国流动人口犯罪呈现出以侵犯财产犯罪为主，犯罪主体以青壮年男性为主，以团伙形式实施的犯罪增加等特点。应针对不同犯罪类型的成罪特点，制定有效的刑罚防控措施，切实加强对流动人口的管理，制定符合流动人口特质的流动人口劳务市场管理、安全保障等法律制度，加快流动人口正当权益保障的法制化进程。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1015213751", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/97000X/201201/40661096.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306542643", "display_name": "中州学刊", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "中州学刊", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2263070277", "doi": null, "title": "美国有限合伙法上“安全港规则＂——以有限责任界定为中心", "publication_date": "2015-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5031522874", "display_name": "粘怡佳", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "粘怡佳", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"“安全港规则”是美国有限合伙法上一项有限责任的重要认定规则，它与“控制权规则”“信赖检验规则”等其他规则共同构成美国有限责任界定的规则体系，在保持有限合伙人有限责任保护和管理权扩张的平衡中发挥着重要作用。中国移植的美国的“安全港规则”在当下有限合伙运用中却面临种种困难和挑战，存在“南橘北枳”制度移植失败的风险。研究美国有限合伙法中“安全港规则”的嬗变和运用的经验，可以为我国修改和完善有限合伙法上的“安全港规则”提供重要借鉴。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2263070277", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/91450X/201502/664655507.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306556299", "display_name": "科技与法律", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "科技与法律", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W217658982", "doi": null, "title": "灵活信任、企业家能力资本化与治理——对家族化合伙创业企业的分析", "publication_date": "2004-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5018329913", "display_name": "张书军", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "张书军", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"本文对家族化合伙创业企业治理结构进行了研究.以个人信任和权威为主要特征的家族化治理结构,在企业成长的不同阶段呈现出阶段性的差异化,对收益索取权和经营控制权的调整是突破治理效率瓶颈的根本.本文指出,信任的灵活性、企业家能力差异度、企业家能力资本化过程等是影响这一过程的重要因素.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:217658982", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/81584X/200404/10215215.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306545086", "display_name": "南开管理评论", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "南开管理评论", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2528464902", "doi": null, "title": "双重股权结构的制度价值阐释与本土化路径探讨——以阿里巴巴集团的“合伙人制度”为切入点", "publication_date": "2016-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5020956575", "display_name": "商鹏", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "商鹏", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"同股同权原则仅仅是公司法制度变迁史上的阶段性原则,而非一成不变的教义,双重股权结构之制度风险并非不可克服。从制度价值层面审视,双重股权结构契合了股东利益诉求异质化的制度演进趋势,有助于提升公司治理效能、增强资本市场的制度竞争力。新一轮资本市场制度改革,应当将双重股权结构纳入改革子菜单之内,并对其作本土化改进。双重股权结构本土化制度设计,应主要从限定适用范围、限定特别股股权权能、明确上市公司释明义务等几个方面着力,以充分激发其制度价值、减少其制度成本、防控其制度风险。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2528464902", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/80057X/201605/668595721.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S2764344465", "display_name": "Hebei faxue", "issn_l": "1002-3933", "issn": ["1002-3933"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4361727542", "host_organization_name": "Hebei Professional College of Political Science and Law", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4361727542"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["Hebei Professional College of Political Science and Law"], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "河北法学", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1023033494", "doi": null, "title": "企业合作创新伙伴选择研究——基于AHP-OVP模型", "publication_date": "2013-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5063236062", "display_name": "杨名", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "杨名", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "middle", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5056922443", "display_name": "潘雄锋", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "潘雄锋", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5055867356", "display_name": "刘荣", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "刘荣", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"合理有效地选择合作创新伙伴对于提高企业合作创新的成功概率尤为重要,怎样选择合适的合作创新伙伴,从源头上控制合作创新的风险是一个全新的课题。针对国内外现有关于企业合作创新伙伴选择方法研究存在的不足,本文将层次分析法（AHP）与密切值法（OVP）进行有机结合,构建了AHP-OVP评估模型,引入到企业合作创新伙伴选择中,并对模型进行了检验,研究结果表明,这种方法有效的结合了层次分析法和密切值法的特点,将人的思维过程数学化、系统化,以便于接受,同时此法没有对指标采用权重,并且优化过程直观、简单、分辨率高,可达到最佳综合决策的效果,能有效的对企业合作创新伙伴进行选择,在一定程度上弥补了以往企业合作创新伙伴选择方法的一些缺陷。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1023033494", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/95695X/201301/44435432.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306549323", "display_name": "技术经济与管理研究", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "技术经济与管理研究", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1004972630", "doi": null, "title": "克服政府过度干预与“内部人控制”的二律背反", "publication_date": "1997-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5007254901", "display_name": "武久立", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "武久立", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"一、政企难分的根源何在早在党的十二届三中全会通过的《中共中央关于经济体制改革的决定》中，中央就已经提出，要解决我国传统体制中的政企不分问题，可是迄今为止政企不分仍困扰着国企改革。首先，政企难分的根源在于所有权与经营权是否可以彻底分开。从西方市场经济发展历史看，单人业主制企业发展到合伙制企业，依然是由所有者直接经营，并负无限责任，风险较大（真正自负盈亏）；到公司制企业时，由于筹集资金和分散风险的需要，股东日益分散化，公司规模也日益扩大，出现了所有权与经营权的分离，所有者（股东）享有选举经营者的权利，同时以出资额为限对公司承担责任，公司则享有股东投资形成的全部法人财产权，同时以其全部资产对债务清偿": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1004972630", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/82665X/199706/671899089199706009.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": null, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": null, "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4400160087", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.37155/2717-5197-0605-69", "title": "建筑工程施工进度管理与控制", "publication_date": "2024-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5099691778", "display_name": "程元敏", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": 